g(m)  = -m^4 + 6*m^2 + 4*m = [
<m, 1>,
<m + 2, 1>,
<m^2 - 2*m - 2, 1>
]
g(-m) = -m^4 + 6*m^2 - 4*m = [
<m - 2, 1>,
<m, 1>,
<m^2 + 2*m - 2, 1>
]
g(m)g(-m) = [
<m - 2, 1>,
<m, 2>,
<m + 2, 1>,
<m^2 - 2*m - 2, 1>,
<m^2 + 2*m - 2, 1>
]
sextic (g*g(-)/m^2) = m^6 - 12*m^4 + 36*m^2 - 16 = [
<m - 2, 1>,
<m + 2, 1>,
<m^2 - 2*m - 2, 1>,
<m^2 + 2*m - 2, 1>
]

H : y^2 = m^6 - 12*m^4 + 36*m^2 - 16  genus 2
H is even in m -> Jac(H) splits.
Ea : y^2 = n^3 - 12*n^2 + 36*n - 16    cond 288
Eb : v^2 = n^4 - 12*n^3 + 36*n^2 - 16*n  ->  Elliptic Curve defined by y^2 = x^3 + 36*x^2 + 192*x + 256 over Rational Field   cond 36
rank(Ea) in [1,1]  torsion [ 2 ]
rank(Eb) in [0,0]  torsion [ 6 ]
=> rank Jac(H) in [1,1]
direct RankBounds(Jac H) = [1,1]

